@Barber.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5118

GET https://localhost:7145/api/tenant
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
###
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/register
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"owner@demo.shop","password":"DemoPass123","firstName":"Demo","lastName":"Owner"}

### Login
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/login
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"owner@demo.shop","password":"DemoPass123"}

### Refresh (expect new pair, old one revoked)
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/refresh
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"kgWM0rdF0O4EnKYxRwjfsFhU24E+yIGoCTeZwVV0dIWWL1byN+4DABPbAIMCS5HykleFP2prl4Y5zLFNblM65A=="}

### Refresh again with the OLD token (expect 401 — rotation check)
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/refresh
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"kgWM0rdF0O4EnKYxRwjfsFhU24E+yIGoCTeZwVV0dIWWL1byN+4DABPbAIMCS5HykleFP2prl4Y5zLFNblM65A=="}

### Logout (expect 204, then refresh with it → 401)
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/logout
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"nbmMmCRKWwruhBTRZWY5HpIm2/evQiZo/J1o03Rrmp9w8kHzbnCnmCIM1YgTJ9pGigBOfSPwnB9QGY8gZDKbPQ=="}